  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If Not Now, Then When?**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Anoxia**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Melting**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **The Book**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **D-Day**: back after 29 archived shows (1138 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Some of Us**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Supreme Ascendancy**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **See Me**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Ataraxia [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kg2021-04-22** (recommended): soundboard; 16 songs; 90 min [1]\n- **kglw2021-04-22**: source not stated; 16 songs; 90 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stu offered audio masters and cover art for free release by labels or fans [1]\n- The performance took place at The Enmore Theatre in Eora, Sydney [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kg2021-04-22**: taped by Nico Wilson, Bonnie Knight, Sam Joseph; source: SBD > WAV [1]\n- **kglw2021-04-22**: taped by Recorded by Nico Wilson, Bonnie Knight and Sam Joseph [2]",
